.route-settings{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,320px),1fr));gap:14px}.route-settings .card{margin:0}.status{font-size:13px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:#e9f5d5;color:#30490b}.status.inactive{background:#eee5fa;color:#655474}summary{cursor:pointer}dialog input[type=text]{width:100%}.weekdays{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.weekdays label{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center}.error{color:#a51832}.notice:empty{display:none}</style></head><body><main><nav><a href="/warehouse-planning">← Route planning</a> · <a href="/warehouse-route-rules">Customer auto-assign rules</a> · <a href="/workspaces?workspace=management">Management</a></nav><h1>Saved routes & weekdays</h1><p>Edit names, delivery weekdays and active status. Existing daily routes keep their names and dates. Customer stop rules stay attached when you rename a route.</p><p id="message" class="notice" role="status"></p><div class="row"><button id="add">Add saved route</button><button id="refresh" class="secondary">Refresh</button><button id="retry" hidden>Retry saved change</button></div><label>Find saved route<input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Route name"></label><p id="count"></p><div id="active" class="route-settings"></div><details id="inactive-section" class="overview-section"><summary id="inactive-title">Inactive routes</summary><div id="inactive" class="route-settings"></div></details></main><dialog id="editor"><h2 id="title"></h2><form id="form"><label>Route name<input id="name" type="text" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="off"></label><div id="settings"><label><input id="enabled" type="checkbox"> Active saved route</label><p>Delivery weekdays — controls adding this saved route and auto-assignment. Leave all selected for flexible routes.</p><div id="weekdays" class="weekdays"></div></div><p id="error" class="error" role="alert"></p><div class="row"><button id="save" type="submit">Save route</button><button id="cancel" type="butt